     "text": "Colour = who decides. Yellow: Max at a named gate (D2). Blue: a skill that proposes, explains, or authors; it never passes or fails anything (D1/D2). Green: a fixed script whose exit code is the verdict (D0). Orange: hooks that intercept every tool call. Purple: parts the plugin uses but does not contain.",
