    {
     "text": "Independence levels: IND-0 existing query decomposed (consistent at best); IND-2 whole A by another model family (reconciled); IND-4 whole A by Max; IND-5 independent reference available (verified). Levels are recorded in the manifest and fix the verdict wording.",
