    },
    {
     "text": "Codex seat (or Max): writes whole A blind from the frozen packet, in a fresh scrubbed process; A is hash-frozen before B starts. Independence IND-2 (IND-4 when Max writes it). The plugin verifies A; it never writes it.",
     "role": "outside",
     "x": 700,
