    {
     "text": "BigQuery (first release): read-only analysis principal (jobUser + dataViewer); optional scratch principal on one expiring dataset (G14). Pinned by FOR SYSTEM_TIME AS OF within the time-travel window, or CTAS freeze. Not bundled: Python client under ADC, or the remote BigQuery MCP.",
